---
import RouteShell from "../../components/RouteShell.astro";
export const prerender = true;
---
<RouteShell title="Knife Care Articles | Miami Knife Guy" description="Clear answers about local knife sharpening costs, restaurant handoffs, maintenance, and mail-in service from Miami Knife Guy." canonicalPath="/learn/">
  <main class="panel" aria-hidden="false"><div class="panel-inner max-w-5xl mx-auto">
    <p class="sub-eyebrow">From the workshop</p>
    <h1 class="sub-headline-cyan text-4xl lg:text-5xl mb-6">Knife care, explained.</h1>
    <p class="sub-body max-w-3xl mb-10">Practical answers to help you choose a service, prepare your knives, and understand what happens next. Written from MKG's published service process and updated when that process changes.</p>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-5">
      <a class="review-card block hover:border-cyan-400/60" href="/learn/miami-knife-sharpening-pickup-cost/"><p class="sub-eyebrow">Local service</p><h2 class="text-white text-2xl font-semibold mb-3">What does knife sharpening pickup cost in Miami?</h2><p class="text-white/75">See how knife work and driven-mile travel are priced separately, with a simple example.</p><span class="text-cyan-300">Read the guide →</span></a>
      <a class="review-card block hover:border-pink-400/60" href="/learn/restaurant-knife-handoff/"><p class="sub-eyebrow">Restaurant kitchens</p><h2 class="text-white text-2xl font-semibold mb-3">How does after-hours knife handoff work?</h2><p class="text-white/75">Plan pickup after the last ticket and return before next-day prep on an agreed schedule.</p><span class="text-cyan-300">Read the guide →</span></a>
    </div>
    <p class="sub-body mt-10">For geometry, thinning, repair, and sharpening angles, read our <a class="text-cyan-300 underline" href="/knife-sharpening-guide/">knife sharpening guide</a>. See <a class="text-cyan-300 underline" href="/proof/">real work</a> and <a class="text-cyan-300 underline" href="/reviews/">customer reviews</a>.</p>
  </div></main>
</RouteShell>
